  "editorial": {
    "status": "working-edition",
    "notes": "The Apostles’ Creed in the declarative devotional recension printed in Enchiridion Indulgentiarum (1952), with the repeated Credo before the third group of articles. The modern Compendium witness instead reads Et in Spíritum Sanctum; that different recension marker is preserved in the witness record and is not silently normalized.",
    "source": {
